{"unit_id":"XiangyuYue__boardwise#card-zh","repo":"XiangyuYue/boardwise","commit":"1965d8421d61def71438e5ed344301060f1bb722","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"boardwise-dsh 是面向 DSH 的硬件设计工具插件：通过注册工具把 Boardwise 的本机 CLI 接入 DSH，并以本地 connector 连接 EasyEDA Pro。它可对导出的设计文件或编辑器中的工程生成检查报告、读取报告章节、收集实时证据并批量标注警告，也提供架构骨架、本机诊断、离线电路绘图编译和绘图回放检查。适合使用 DSH 辅助原理图与 PCB 设计审阅、整理审查结果或编译绘图的硬件工程师。需在本机安装 Boardwise CLI；实时工程功能还需 EasyEDA Pro 与 connector。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-plugin/src/index.ts:26-43","dsh-plugin/src/review-tools.ts:46-95","dsh-plugin/src/draw-tools.ts:30-78"]}
{"unit_id":"XiangyuYue__boardwise#card-en","repo":"XiangyuYue/boardwise","commit":"1965d8421d61def71438e5ed344301060f1bb722","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"boardwise-dsh adds Boardwise design tools to DSH. It calls the local CLI to review exported or live EasyEDA Pro designs, read reports, collect evidence, triage findings, and compile or replay circuit drawings offline. Install the Boardwise CLI; live review also requires the EasyEDA connector.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-plugin/src/index.ts:26-43","dsh-plugin/src/shared-tools.ts:19-31","dsh-plugin/src/draw-tools.ts:30-78"]}
